{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find and grab object - if close, grab it and process it, else approach it. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = SearchForObject    /> <Action ID = ContinueExploring    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHidden    />",
